  The IIS counterpart of .htaccess. The self-test is never served by IIS, and
  this file states no rule: it is here because tools/ci/build-archive.sh
  requires the guard files beside an index.php. An extension with a real entry
  point writes its own deny-all-but-index.php rules here and checks them on IIS.
-->
